    "objective": "将 Coding Tools MCP 从每个 Workspace 一个 MCP Runtime/连接升级为全局唯一 MCP Endpoint 管理全部 Workspace；按 MCP session 选择活动 Workspace，并在每次工具调用开始时冻结不可变 Workspace RequestContext；保持文件、命令、Planning、History、Secrets、Runtime Policy、Usage 与输出日志的 Workspace 隔离；最终完成 0.3.0 发布闸门。",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "372312b88c7c456a88e4c555c091b01c",
        "title": "P0.1 冻结 0.2.x 行为基线并盘点每 Workspace MCP 耦合点，明确 0.3.0 删除项、迁移项和必须保持的数据。",
        "type": "agent_action",
        "expectedOutputs": [
          "baseline",
          "coupling inventory",
          "migration boundary"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "97e78adc7a4149219ed287444a895e42",
        "title": "P0.2 建立唯一 Global MCP Runtime、固定 HTTP Endpoint、WorkspaceRegistry 和 GatewaySessionScope；未选择 Workspace 时 fail-closed。",
        "type": "agent_action",
        "dependsOn": [
          "372312b88c7c456a88e4c555c091b01c"
        ],
        "expectedOutputs": [
          "global listener",
          "session registry",
          "WORKSPACE_NOT_SELECTED"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "2e10b30afee14902b7e852b0bc985ac9",
        "title": "P0.3 在 dispatch 入口冻结不可变 Workspace RequestContext，消除并发 Workspace 切换 race。",
        "type": "agent_action",
        "dependsOn": [
          "97e78adc7a4149219ed287444a895e42"
        ],
        "expectedOutputs": [
          "immutable request context",
          "concurrency safety"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "f13cddb6820f466a861448c3060df68b",
        "title": "P0.4 增加 workspace_list、workspace_current、workspace_select、workspace_invoke 最小工具面，并禁止任意绝对 root。",
        "type": "agent_action",
        "dependsOn": [
          "97e78adc7a4149219ed287444a895e42",
          "2e10b30afee14902b7e852b0bc985ac9"
        ],
        "expectedOutputs": [
          "workspace tools",
          "schemas",
          "session header handling"
        ]
      },
      {
