        "title": "P0.6 将 OAuth/Bearer、LAN bind、Global Gateway/FRP/Cloudflare 和公网 URL 收口到全局 Endpoint，删除 Workspace 级连接语义和 UI。",
        "type": "agent_action",
        "dependsOn": [
          "d835f036347a4ec4a485b06d4b54ff8b"
        ],
        "expectedOutputs": [
          "global auth",
